# Toxic's poison counters are put by the creature's controller (CR 702.164c), so Innkeeper's Talent's level 3, "If you would
# put one or more counters on a permanent or player, put twice that many ... instead", doubles them (the ruling: Vorinclex
# can apply). Their number is the total toxic value, whatever the damage (the ruling): Bot1's Phyrexian Mite from Mirrex,
# 3/3 with the two +1/+1 counters the Talent's combat trigger puts on it (doubled), deals Bot2 3 damage on turn 5 and gives
# 2 poison counters - toxic 1, doubled - not 3 or 6.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Sol Ring
Black Lotus
Innkeeper's Talent
Mox Emerald
Mox Ruby
Plains
Mirrex
Plains x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

